Subject: name the window app_id org.kde.plasma-camera in the desktop entry

KAboutData derives the Wayland app_id from the component name, plasma-camera,
while the entry is org.kde.plasma.camera.desktop, so the task manager can only
match the window to its entry through StartupWMClass.

--- a/org.kde.plasma.camera.desktop
+++ b/org.kde.plasma.camera.desktop
@@ -102,3 +102,4 @@
 Exec=plasma-camera
 Categories=Qt;KDE;AudioVideo;
 X-KDE-FormFactor=desktop;tablet;handset;
+StartupWMClass=org.kde.plasma-camera
